@startuml
title MEDORA -- Invoice Lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F9FE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #183247
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  BorderColor #2563A6
  FontColor #183247
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2563A6
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  BorderColor #2563A6
  FontColor #183247
  FontSize 18
  ArrowColor #2563A6
}
[*] --> Draft : create from eligible items
Draft --> Issued : validate totals and issue
Issued --> Unpaid : no payment recorded
Issued --> PartiallyPaid : payment recorded [amount < balance]
Issued --> Paid : payment recorded [amount = balance]
Unpaid --> PartiallyPaid : payment recorded [amount < balance]
Unpaid --> Paid : payment recorded [amount = balance]
PartiallyPaid --> PartiallyPaid : additional partial payment
PartiallyPaid --> Paid : payment settles balance
note right of Paid
  Refunds and adjustments are separate, auditable transactions.
  They do not erase the original invoice or payment history.
end note
Paid --> [*]
@enduml